<title>GERMANY: Daimler-Benz overhaul plan almost finished.</title>
<headline>Daimler-Benz overhaul plan almost finished.</headline>
<byline>Michael Able</byline>
<dateline>STUTTGART, Germany 1996-12-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>German industrial giant Daimler-Benz AG has told managers a plan to shake up its structure is almost complete despite signs that powerful Mercedes-Benz head Helmut Werner remains opposed.</p>
<p>Chairman Juergen Schrempp and finance chief Manfred Gentz wrote in a letter to managers dated November 26 and seen by Reuters on Sunday that the management board had settled on a model to submit for supervisory board approval on January 23.</p>
</text>
